Subject: [PATCH 1/9] Add OpenAI ChatGPT provider support

Add ChatGPT-plan PKCE and device-code OAuth, isolated refreshable credential storage, and grok openai login/logout/status commands. Wire the chatgpt_oauth scheme into the Codex Responses transport, including live bearer/account-header resolution, history normalization, complete SSE reconstruction, and strict handling of unknown events.
